{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, atmospheric horror story designed to be experienced in a single, late-night sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Approximate Playtime:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~25 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open late at night, you\u2019ve finally realized your dream of running a cozy mazesoba ramen stall. But it\u2019s strange; no other food stands seem to be serving this late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boil noodles, chop toppings, and prepare the best midnight mazesoba in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.poster.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.webm?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.mp4?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve a variety of late-night customers, keep up during meal rushes, and discover what happened to the other stalls that once lined the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.poster.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.webm?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.mp4?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each night, purchase new ingredients and upgrades for your stall. Some items can improve orders, while others might affect the strange events around your cart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/e1479520ece4752b92664ca03c962472.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night deepens, the  something in the air begins to shift. The streets  grow quiet and uneasy. Lights flicker, shadows stretch, and a sense of unease builds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.poster.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.webm?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Settle into the cozy, meditative rhythm of cooking and serving bowls of mazesoba, balancing preparation with the pace of customer orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery</strong>: Uncover why your cart is the only one still open after dark, and what happened to the rest of the late-night food vendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Focus on growing your reputation as a food stall owner. Horror elements are turned off, letting you decide between a purely cozy experience tinged with unsettling atmosphere. (Unavailable in the demo)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2855180?t=1762375424","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/c19b8f9c0a8722530a6036801c91ea091d3581ee/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762375424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/403a00a1a9aaadb8399c372c2793ccea4400b06b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762375424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/403a00a1a9aaadb8399c372c2793ccea4400b06b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762375424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains mild horror elements including brief jump scares and unsettling imagery."},"demos":[{"appid":4096320,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short, atmospheric horror story designed to be experienced in a single, late-night sitting.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Approximate Playtime:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~25 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open late at night, you\u2019ve finally realized your dream of running a cozy mazesoba ramen stall. But it\u2019s strange; no other food stands seem to be serving this late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boil noodles, chop toppings, and prepare the best midnight mazesoba in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.poster.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.webm?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/d0129bf9a5cd5f769a3361c4078524f7.mp4?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve a variety of late-night customers, keep up during meal rushes, and discover what happened to the other stalls that once lined the street.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.poster.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.webm?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/7004982b92b5fe694337fa8a52d18460.mp4?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each night, purchase new ingredients and upgrades for your stall. Some items can improve orders, while others might affect the strange events around your cart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/e1479520ece4752b92664ca03c962472.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the night deepens, the  something in the air begins to shift. The streets  grow quiet and uneasy. Lights flicker, shadows stretch, and a sense of unease builds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.poster.avif?t=1762375424\" width=1000 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/extras/8542574aaed7eafd64c2bacfd576f28e.webm?t=1762375424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong>: Settle into the cozy, meditative rhythm of cooking and serving bowls of mazesoba, balancing preparation with the pace of customer orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery</strong>: Uncover why your cart is the only one still open after dark, and what happened to the rest of the late-night food vendors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: Focus on growing your reputation as a food stall owner. Horror elements are turned off, letting you decide between a purely cozy experience tinged with unsettling atmosphere. (Unavailable in the demo)</p>","developers":["MagiStone Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2855180/b1841ce47bc908e20fab9a3f6990825b32d7ab72/header.jpg?t=1762375424","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2855180/1473010782/b1da1604d7e578be5df500ecc8517a8634a4e0d4/1758679161/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759177115","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2855180/1473010782/b1da1604d7e578be5df500ecc8517a8634a4e0d4/1758679161/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759177115","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2855180/1473010782/b1da1604d7e578be5df500ecc8517a8634a4e0d4/1758679161/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759177115","id":257205112,"name":"Off